jstvi/?hledate-praci-navstivte-veletrhprace-a-vzdelavani-klic-kprilezitostem-75428</span></a></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\">Plzeňský kraj<br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">12. 1. 2015</span></span></span></span><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"http://www.plzensky-kraj.cz/cs/clanek/veletrh-prace-a-vzdelavani-klic-k-prilezitostem-0\"><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\">http://www.plzensky-kraj.cz/cs/clanek/veletrh-prace-a-vzdelavani-klic-k-prilezitostem-0</span></a></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\">Qap.cz</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">11. 1. 2015</span></span></span><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"http://www.qap.cz/spolecnost/object/v-plzni-se-chysta-veletrh-prace-a-vzdelavani-klic-k-prilezitostem-65563/article.htm\"><span style=\"font-size: small; color: #ff0000;\">http://www.qap.cz/spolecnost/object/v-plzni-se-chysta-veletrh-prace-a-vzdelavani-klic-k-prilezitostem-65563/article.htm</span></a></p>', '', '', 'anv1305', '2015-09-23 12:56:12');
