ng></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: medium;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Totem, z.s.<br /></strong></span></strong></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Úřad práce České republiky, Eures</strong></span></strong></span></strong></span></strong></span></p>', '', '', 'administrator', '2022-11-09 16:24:31');
