ica,sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><a href=\"http://plzen.cz/na-veletrhu-prace-v-plzni-poradi-zdarma-pravnik-optik-karierni-poradce-i-grafolog-48216/\" target=\"_blank\">Plzen.cz 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><a href=\"http://plzensky.denik.cz/zpravy_region/pri-veletrhu-prace-a-vzdelavani-zdarma-poradi-pravnik-optik-i-grafolog-20160118.html\" target=\"_blank\">Plzeňský deník 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"files/7325376.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Mladá fronta dnes 19.1.2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"files/2075226.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Plzeňská kraj 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><a href=\"files/2143062.doc\" target=\"_blank\">BusinessInfo web 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"files/1756171.doc\" target=\"_blank\">Městský obvod 3 web 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"files/1715621.doc\" target=\"_blank\">Nepomuk web 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"files/2301647.doc\" target=\"_blank\">Rok průmyslu web 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"files/1735409.doc\" target=\"_blank\">InfoDnes web 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"files/3447796.doc\" target=\"_blank\">Finanční noviny web 1/2016</a></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: small; font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"files/2045575.doc\" target=\"_blank\">Tisková zpráva ÚP web 1/2016</a></s